ter":{"name":"Teknium","email":"127238744+teknium1@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T05:57:26Z"},"message":"test(skills): morning-brief no longer pins the google-workspace attachment\n\nThat parametrized row asserted the exact attachment this PR removes (it is what\nmade the routine fail for users without Google setup); the other three\nblueprint-to-skill rows are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"76b102746f7542de5bd73fb401922b10e615f812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/76b102746f7542de5bd73fb401922b10e615f812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/9b43b4bca2f3e87db76e2b8623239c6a40aedb6e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/9b43b4bca2f3e87db76e2b8623239c6a40aedb6e","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/9b43b4bca2f3e87db76e2b8623239c6a40aedb6e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/9b43b4bca2f3e87db76e2b8623239c6a40aedb6e/comments","author":{"login":"teknium1","id":127238744,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5WCWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1","html_url":"https://github.com/teknium1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"teknium1","id":127238744,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5WCWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1","html_url":"https://github.com/teknium1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc"}]},{"sha":"7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","node_id":"C_kwDOPRF1G9oAKDdmZjRhMDU5ZWNmNGUwOGE2MjQ5ZjllNDI1N2ViYThkOGIxNmU3Y2M","commit":{"author":{"name":"Teknium","email":"127238744+teknium1@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T02:29:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"Teknium","email":"127238744+teknium1@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T05:57:26Z"},"message":"fix(cron): built-in Morning briefing no longer fails for users without Google setup\n\nThe morning-brief blueprint attached the google-workspace skill. That skill\ndeclares required credential files (google_token.json,\ngoogle_client_secret.json), so cron preflight refused every run for anyone who\nhad not done the Google OAuth setup: \"attached skill 'google-workspace' is not\nready\". The prompt's own fallback (\"if no data sources are connected, give a\nbrief good-morning\") could never run, and users who connected Gmail/Calendar\nas hosted connected apps were still blocked by the unused skill.\n\nDrop the attached skill and make the prompt source-agnostic: read calendar\nand mail from whatever is connected (connected apps or a set-up skill), with\nthe brief-composition rules inlined (day window, conflicts, meeting prep,\nmail that needs a reply). The no-source path now actually runs.\n\nAdds one invariant test: no built-in blueprint attaches a bundled skill that\ndeclares required credential files or env vars, since preflight would refuse\nit on first run for every user who has not set that skill up.","tree":{"sha":"270845e4812c56c9d73e9d3a2c697ff602e9e060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/270845e4812c56c9d73e9d3a2c697ff602e9e060"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/7ff4a059ecf4e08a6249f9e4257eba8d8b16e7cc/comments","author":{"login":"teknium1","id":127238744,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5WCWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1","html_url":"https://github.com/teknium1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users