S.","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-24T04:16:56Z"},"message":"test(gateway): open the session prompt hook fixtures on the storage interface\n\nMain replaced SessionDB and hermes_state_runtime with the persistence handle,\nso both fixtures now seed, begin the epoch, admit and claim through it.","tree":{"sha":"0e6579389756be880e1a65270f49febbf1ea1de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/0e6579389756be880e1a65270f49febbf1ea1de4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/084538cdb605f3aeacbbeb32903bceefed59a905","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/084538cdb605f3aeacbbeb32903bceefed59a905","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/084538cdb605f3aeacbbeb32903bceefed59a905","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/084538cdb605f3aeacbbeb32903bceefed59a905/comments","author":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8"}]},{"sha":"2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","node_id":"C_kwDOPRF1G9oAKDI1NzhiNWM5NTVlMzBmZjBkOGZiZmRmYWQxN2JkYjM2ZTZjMTQzYzg","commit":{"author":{"name":"unsupportedpastels","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-11T05:36:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mark S.","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-24T04:16:56Z"},"message":"fix(gateway): make copies of the pending prompt table inert snapshots\n\nPromptTable is a dict subclass whose observed bookkeeping is an instance\nattribute. copy.copy shared that dict with the original, so popping a\nprompt from the copy fired on_session_prompt_settled while the original\nstill held the prompt and dropped the original's bookkeeping;\ncopy.deepcopy deep-copied the bookkeeping and its owning authority and\nraised.\n\nBoth now return a plain-dict snapshot, as dict.copy already does: it\nnever fires a hook and never touches the original. No production caller\ncopies the table today.","tree":{"sha":"96e8dae24733f600764d4624ea574b866b99c6a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/96e8dae24733f600764d4624ea574b866b99c6a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/2578b5c955e30ff0d8fbfdfad17bdb36e6c143c8/comments","author":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde"}]},{"sha":"bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","node_id":"C_kwDOPRF1G9oAKGJiZGNiNzlmN2UxM2ExMzE0NmFjMzNjZjAzZjk5NDgyYWViOWZkZGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"unsupportedpastels","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-11T05:35:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mark S.","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-24T04:16:56Z"},"message":"fix(gateway): redact session prompt params inside the owner scope\n\nThe registered password-manager values that redaction scrubs are kept per\nprofile and looked up for the profile the current context is bound to.\nThe session prompt hook dispatch redacted params before entering the\nowning authority's scope, so a prompt asked from a thread bound to\nanother profile (or to none) handed the owning profile's plugins its own\nregistered vault values unscrubbed.\n\nEnter the owner scope first, then redact, then invoke the hook. Without\nan owning authority the asker's copied context is used, as before.","tree":{"sha":"84f13408f7567888b7ade29a6a80f3568b116428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/84f13408f7567888b7ade29a6a80f3568b116428"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/bbdcb79f7e13a13146ac33cf03f99482aeb9fdde/comments","author":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c"}]},{"sha":"5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","node_id":"C_kwDOPRF1G9oAKDVmOTVjZGIyYzE1OTMwNDJhN2IzMTAzOWEwY2Y1MWVjOTg5YmU3MmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"unsupportedpastels","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-11T03:02:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mark S.","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-24T04:16:56Z"},"message":"test(gateway): wait for fanout writes in the session prompt hook tests\n\nFanoutTransport delivers frames to a peer on its own writer thread, so a\ntest that read the fake viewer's frames right after the asker returned could\nmiss the request frame or the request.cancel teardown (1 failure in ~10\nruns). Poll for them with tests.waiting.wait_until instead.","tree":{"sha":"ab8a2fc2b88bc3b28deabd8ec2d1f971df3e2ca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/ab8a2fc2b88bc3b28deabd8ec2d1f971df3e2ca2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/5f95cdb2c1593042a7b31039a0cf51ec989be72c/comments","author":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714"}]},{"sha":"06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","node_id":"C_kwDOPRF1G9oAKDA2Mjk2ZTI2OWU2YWUxZTIyODI2OTkwYzdhM2UwNjg0YWQ0Yzc3MTQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"unsupportedpastels","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-11T02:54:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mark S.","email":"theoldwizard123@pm.me","date":"2026-11-24T04:16:56Z"},"message":"feat(plugins): tell plugins which prompt a gateway session is waiting on\n\nAdd two observer hooks, on_session_prompt and on_session_prompt_settled,\nfired by the gateway session owner for each prompt a person answers for a\nsession's viewers, with the id that answers it:\n\n- approval / clarify: when SessionAuthority.register_approval /\n  register_clarify has published the approval.request / clarify.request\n  event (prompt_id = the event's prompt_id); settled whenever the prompt\n  leaves PendingControls.pending (snapshot, a remote_responders answer, a\n  managed worker's prompt_settled frame), reason \"settled\".\n- request frames: when session_server_requests._ask has opened and written a\n  sudo, secret, clarify (batch), vault.unlock_prompt, vault.code or\n  vault.save_login frame (prompt_id = the srq- id); settled after its\n  request.cancel with that event's reason. Window requests, replay=False\n  requests and an _ask that returns early never fire.\n\nparams is a deep copy of what the viewers received with every string\nforce-redacted through redact_approval_display(force=True); it never holds\nan answer. Calls are queued to one FIFO worker thread, so plugin code never\nruns under event_stream.lock or the request registry lock, on the agent\nthread or on the event loop, and each runs in the owning profile's\nowner_scope (for a request frame: the served authority whose live session\nowns the stream, else the asker's context). Plugin exceptions are logged\nat debug and swallowed. Event payloads, publish order, open_requests\nreplay, return values and on_human_input_* are unchanged.\n\nBoth names join VALID_HOOKS and are documented in the observer-hooks,\nhooks, plugins and plugin developer guide pages.","tree":{"sha":"7cbad61df633e604818c009c300267251042e6e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/7cbad61df633e604818c009c300267251042e6e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/06296e269e6ae1e22826990c7a3e0684ad4c7714/comments","author":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"unsupportedpastels","id":274530371,"node_id":"U_kgDOEF0AQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274530371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels","html_url":"https://github.com/unsupportedpastels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unsupportedpastels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"ht